  "info": {
    "title": "2dog",
    "version": "4.7.1.49",
    "description": "2dog command-line tool and project templates. `dnx 2dog convert` converts an existing Godot project to the 2dog layout (nested host projects for desktop, browser-wasm and xUnit testing); `dotnet new install 2dog` provides the `dotnet new 2dog` project template. The engine library itself is the 2dog.engine package."
  },
